<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>昨日までのルール今日はただのルーズ</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:47.500
This program should significantly expand the Chaos Emerald's search range.

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.210
Sonic, give me the Chaos Emerald.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:53.250
Okay.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.170
Set.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.970
Connecting to Circuit 124875 and powering on!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.270
Knuckles, is everything okay?

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.270
Everything's fine.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:16.650
What is it, Tails?

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.150
I'm detecting a Chaos Emerald!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.540
Chris, you're fantastic.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.700
It's no big deal.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:32.080
It is a big deal. Even I can't make a program like this in one night.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.550
You're embarrassing me, Tails.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.510
Amy, check the location.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.590
Space coordinates 265007. Planet Breezer.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:44.050
Coordinates confirmed. Heading towards Planet Breezer.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.390
Master Drive!

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.060
I'm the captain. That's supposed to be my line...

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.160
I'm saying it this time! Master Drive!

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.410
Episode 57

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.410
Fight at the Ice Palace!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.260
It doesn't matter where Sonic warps to.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:14.020
As long as I have this Pan-Space Tracking System, I can detect his location.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.730
I am such a genius.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:18.900
Egg Drive!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.650
Egg Drive!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.880
Chaos Emerald verified.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:49.930
The weather is terrible. There's a blizzard across the entire planet.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.810
Maybe they stole its Planet Egg.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.440
That's why the weather is unnatural.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.990
The plants are...

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.160
Let's check out the land.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.490
Is that okay, Sonic?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.120
No problem!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:32.850
Don't worry. Tails can land safely.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.110
What's happening?

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.480
It's Metarex!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.490
Take this!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.880
Emergency landing!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.740
Knuckles, what's the damage?

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.320
The engine room is fine.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:35.290
However, Engines #1 and #3 were hit.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.040
It doesn't look like we can fly.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.000
Roger.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:50.760
I'm detecting a lot of signals.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.800
Is it Metarex?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:57.810
We have to take covert action. Let's make a base camp and approach.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.850
Covert action? Base camp?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.190
That sounds cool!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.320
Now that that's settled...

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.940
Here!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.440
What's this?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:12.320
You don't know what it is? It's a shovel, of course!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.920
I'm depressed.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.460
There you are, Bokkun!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.510
That voice...

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:32.550
You act like you didn't want to see me.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.430
That's not true!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.760
Of course not.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:39.310
Bokkun, I have another favor to ask.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:43.560
I know you understand the situation.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.610
I do.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.830
I'll bring good news.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.580
Sonic, no!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.300
That's why I brought snow walkers.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.050
No way!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.520
What are you doing?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.690
I'm trying to talk to this tree.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.440
You can do that?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.520
I hope this tree is still alive...

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.990
But I can't hear anything.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:35.360
It's not responding because it's cold.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.450
It's dead.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:52.510
I thought this would be a simple search for the Chaos Emerald, but Metarexes are here.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.470
We have to check things out.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:58.220
Please take me with you!

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.350
That's too risky.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.470
I don't want this to happen to any more planets!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:06.560
That's why I need to know what happened to this planet.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.560
Still...

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.730
Let's go, Sonic.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.360
Chris...

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:17.530
I can fight and protect Cosmo.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.070
Okay, buddy.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:24.040
Thank you, Sonic and Chris!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.710
I'm going too!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.150
Taking off!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.100
Is it easy to fix?

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:29.770
Sonic may be in danger, so hurry up, Captain!

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.900
Don't worry. Trust me!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.990
She only calls me "Captain" at times like this...

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.780
Did you say something?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.610
N-No.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.740
Excellent!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.370
Hey!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.210
I figured you were hungry, so I brought food.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.000
Wow! Sticky rice cakes!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.710
And sweet rice wine!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.760
You've been unusually attentive lately.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.050
R-Really?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:07.520
Looks delicious! After we drink the rice wine, let's grill and eat the rice cakes!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:22.110
I knew this would happen. It's a good thing that I didn't need to eat.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.370
That was easy.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.370
The Chaos Emerald is mine.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.840
What an annoying wind!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.840
Here they come!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.180
I know!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.470
Sonic!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.310
Got it!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.440
You punks!

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.120
Don't let them get away, Chris!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.420
Don't worry!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.350
Oh no! It's a trap!

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.750
We won't make it!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.480
We made it just in time.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.730
Look at that!

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.330
It's beautiful. It looks like jewelry.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.920
Oh my!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.800
Use this, Sonic!

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.390
Chris, don't you have one for me?

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.020
Sorry, I only made one for Sonic.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.360
What?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:06.030
He always gets the spotlight.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.700
I'm jealous.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.160
The Chaos Emerald is inside the palace up ahead.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.960
We're counting on you!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.540
Roger!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.420
Hang on, Knuckles!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.180
Go!

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.700
You guys are an eyesore!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:57.040
Knuckles seems very angry.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.330
You think so?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:06.460
If it was all jewelry, it would be wonderful.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.430
Screw Kick!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:05.190
Chaos Emerald...

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.200
Sonic, you found it.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.070
Yeah.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.790
Shovel Claw!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.960
What's with this ice?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.960
I commend you for making it this far.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.010
But you don't have the power to destroy the ice.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.760
Where are you? Show yourself!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:36.100
If you want to see me, I'll show myself right now.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.690
You punk!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.990
You fools, it's pointless.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.210
This is bad! Let's get out of here!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.220
Hurry!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.960
We'll help!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.350
We can't use the main gun.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.310
That ice is incredible!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.030
Got them!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.130
Sonic! What should we do?

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.340
I'm sorry!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.890
You saved us, Cosmo.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.230
Even though it's solid, it's still made of ice.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.900
Knuckles, retreat!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.410
Everything's ready, Chris.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:04.030
Knuckles, energize the laser cannon using the Master Emerald's power!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.080
Roger!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:15.170
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.550
Chaos is power. Power comes from the heart.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:26.810
Charging energy 70%... 80%...

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.690
Energy charge complete!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.190
Fire!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.780
That's pointless!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.740
I found it!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:32.290
Jewelry doesn't look good on hedgehogs.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.920
Damn bat girl!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.290
Why is Rouge here?

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.710
Let's go after her, Sonic!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.350
Look.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.230
It's new life.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:00.230
This planet will someday be full of lush greenery.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.780
I'm sure of it.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:02.440
Yes!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:12.710
How could you fall asleep at such an important time?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:16.080
You slept too, Dr. Eggman!

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:19.880
None of this would have happened if Bokkun didn't bring the food!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:23.670
It wasn't my fault! It was...

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.180
It was...?

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.300
Nothing!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.930
Why me?

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:43.570
I'm chilled to the bones.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.320
I'm going to get rough skin.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.360
But...

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:52.870
It's really beautiful. It was worth all the trouble.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:01.960
What's the meaning of this?

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.420
I know!

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:08.340
When I analyzed the Chaos Emerald's detection records, the data said it wasn't the real thing.

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:12.810
The difference was so small that you couldn't tell at a glance.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:16.850
I adjusted the program so that we won't detect fakes anymore.

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.980
What was it doing with a fake Chaos Emerald?

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:26.030
Perhaps an experiment? Maybe it has something to do with why they attacked Sonic...

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.570
Anyway, that bat girl was tricked!

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:35.000
I stole a fake?

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:39.710
How frustrating!

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:54.270
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:54.270
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:54.270
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:49.180
<i>Original Concept Created by</i>

